{"id":"a6o2tkb32977o05ubamxbaad3","title":"酸性条件下电催化CO₂还原为多碳产物的挑战与策略","originalTitle":"Green Carbon文章丨酸性电催化CO&#8322;还原为多碳产物","summary":"中国科学院青岛生物能源与过程研究所朱佳伟研究员及其团队在 Green Carbon 发表综述文章，探讨了酸性条件下电催化CO₂还原为多碳产物的反应机理、催化剂设计策略及面临的挑战。文章指出，通过调控局部碱性微环境、促进C−C偶联及提高催化剂稳定性，可以有效提升CO₂还原为多碳产物的效率和选择性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3620330&do=blog&id=1560601"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T08:46:07.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T13:23:00.009Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T13:23:00.009Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表"],"score":33,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"83a73494-428d-40d2-9ade-e1bda8d3ffa4","title":"朱佳伟团队综述酸性电催化CO₂还原挑战与策略"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"83a73494-428d-40d2-9ade-e1bda8d3ffa4","title":"朱佳伟团队综述酸性电催化CO₂还原挑战与策略"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fAriVA05uP3g","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}